  "reference": "Baatuli 13",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsarela elili cheŋi chatama kumesu aYehova. Yehova wayinkeluwu aFwilistinu nyaka makumi awana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwadiŋi iyala wumu wakuZora, wakuchisaka chaDani, ijina dindi Manowa; Iŋodindi wadiŋi nshinta, kuvwala anyana nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kaYehova wadi mwekesheli kudi mumbanda, wamwilili nindi, Tala dinu, eyiwunshinta, hiwavwalaŋaku; ilaŋa wakabaaba ivumu, wakavwala mwanaweyala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu babalaku mwani, bayi wakanwa hela vinyu helawalwa wayilaku; bayi wakadya chuma chajilaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wakabaaba ivumu, wakavwala mwana weyala; mpoku yachayi bayi yakahita kunamutuwinduku, muloŋa owu mwana wakekala kaNaziri kambala kaNzambi, kufumisha hakuvwalika mwivumu. Wakatachika kuyamwina aIsarela kudi aFwilistinu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda wayili nakumushimwinamu nfumwindi, nindi, Muntu waNzambi wenza kudami, kumesu indi kwadiŋi neyi kumesu akaŋelu kaNzambi, kumutala chi kweti niwoma; hinamwihula kwafumayuku, helayena kunleja ijina dindi nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Tiya, eyi wakabaaba ivumu, wakavwala mwana weyala. Dichi dinu bayi wakanwa hela vinyuhela walwa wayilaku, bayi wakadya hela chuma chajilaku, muŋa owumwana wakekala kaNaziri kambala kaNzambi, kufumisha hakuvwalika mwivumu anamutuukishi ndo nikwifuku damba kafwayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Manowa wamulembeleli Yehova, nindi, Eyi Mwanta mwani, ona muntu waNzambi watemesha, enzi cheŋi kudetu atuleji mutwa kamwila mwana wakavwalika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi watiyililili kwizu daManowa, kapelu kaNzambi wenjili cheŋi kudi mumbanda chadiŋi nakushakamayi mwiha; ilaŋa nfumwindi Manowa hadipi ninduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda wanyakeli, watemukili nakuya nakumuleja nfumwindi, nindi, Muntu wadi mwekesheli kudami iwu! Ona wenza ifuku diŋa dadiŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manowa yonyamu kaniku nyamuka, yomulonda niŋodindi, yoshika nikudi muntu, hakumwila nindi, Yeyi muntu wahosha naniwu mumbanda? Yena nindi, Yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manowa nindi, Muwahosha mumwekani. Owu mwana wakela ŋahi? Wakakoŋa mudimwinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kaYehova wamwilili Manowa nindi, Mwejima munamuleja mumbanda ababali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi akadya chuma chikufu maku muvinyu, hela kunwa vinyu hela walwa wayila, hela kudya chuma chajilaku; munamwila akelumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manowa wamwilili kapelu kaYehova, nindi, Imanaku mwani, tukutelekeli mwana kampembi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kaYehova wamwilili Manowa, nindi, Wukupimika tuhu; hinukudya yakudya yeyuku. Neyi wunakeŋi kuloŋesha himulambu wakushita, chipa wuhimulambu li Yehova. Muloŋa Manowa helukilinindi hikaŋelu kaYehovaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manowa wamwilili kaŋelu kaYehova nindi, ijina deyi yeyinyi? Kulonda neyi mazu eyi anamwekani dehi twakakulemeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapelu kaYehova wamwilili nindi, Wukwihwiladi ijina dami? Dakujinda kwadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu Manowa watweii mwanakampembi hamu nahimulambu wawuŋa, oku kwilola wayilambwili kuri Yehova. Mweliliyi kaŋelu kaYehova mwakuhayama hohu; aManowa naŋodindi hiyakutala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kesi kadiŋi hakameŋa chikakuzuboka kwiwulu, kaŋelu kaYehova hakukandama kwiwulu mukesi kakukameŋa; aMano wanaŋo dindi hiyakutala; adimbuka nichamesu hamaseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kaYehova hadimwekesheli cheŋi hela kudi Manowa hela kudi iŋodi nduku. Manowa eluka nikwiluka nindi komana hikaŋelu kaYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manowa wamwilili inodindi nindi, Twakafwa hohu, muloŋa tunamumoni dehi Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchinka Iŋodindi nindi, Neyi Yehova wakeŋa a kutujaha atambuli kumakasetu himulambu wakushita nihimulambu wawuŋa? Atulejiyuma yejimiyi? Atushimwini mwenimu mwanatu shimwiniyi katataka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda yovwala ni mwana weyala, yonamutumba nijina dindi, nindi Samisoni; mwana yokula nikukula, Yehova wamukiswilili nkisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu ya Yehova hakutachika kumwendesha muMahane Dani, Zora iku, Eshetawoliiku, Mahane Dani hakachi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
